                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more revolting"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "fdcdf604-fbc3-42af-b994-c1dbfb15ea3a",
                        "entry_id": "a42afe72-cb1f-3efa-8c8a-7b1063d80157",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most revolting"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1401f34c-f9f4-3120-adb3-c281201ee2ca",
                        "entry_id": "a42afe72-cb1f-3efa-8c8a-7b1063d80157",
                        "glosses": [
                            "repulsive, disgusting"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c559ec5b-8712-4e09-8a71-14521a6743f0",
                                "sense_id": "1401f34c-f9f4-3120-adb3-c281201ee2ca",
                                "text": "The most revolting smell was coming from the drains."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b2401fb-2215-480b-a69d-65f9547f6f10",
                                "sense_id": "1401f34c-f9f4-3120-adb3-c281201ee2ca",
                                "text": "Why anyone should want such a revolting object had always been a mystery to me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "451456ee-8f93-426e-a440-75853ea50873",
                                "sense_id": "1401f34c-f9f4-3120-adb3-c281201ee2ca",
                                "text": "The Leicester Daily Mercury reflected on how these concerns were the result of changing ways of getting around: \"It might sound a bit crazy or just a little revolting that at Christmas works parties, some should drink themselves into a near-insensible state... This was not serious when they used public transport, but today more men and women use their own cars.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b093a6e7-5840-4f55-95ad-dc306a2e33ee",
                        "source_entry_id": "a42afe72-cb1f-3efa-8c8a-7b1063d80157",
                        "source_sense_id": "1401f34c-f9f4-3120-adb3-c281201ee2ca",
                        "source_sense_description": "repellent",
                        "target_lang_word": "repoussant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "repoussant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f18fdf3a-948d-3d68-a296-2e647d1d0852",
                                        "entry_id": "f213f864-4bdf-3a23-bb0e-d6de5a97b3b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui inspire de l’aversion, du dégoût."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea4ef4d6-92aa-4b2d-9726-a663e8fab4d0",
                                                "sense_id": "f18fdf3a-948d-3d68-a296-2e647d1d0852",
                                                "text": "Sale et productif comme le commerce, ce passage, toujours plein d’allants et de venants, de charrettes, de haquets, est d’un aspect repoussant, et la population qui y grouille est en harmonie avec les choses et les lieux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "repoussant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3981257d-bc22-3e31-8386-9eacd766eda0",
                                        "entry_id": "3dc64306-4289-356f-9249-545834347107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Participe présent de repousser."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d83ced7d-1a36-44a8-bb7f-abf8b88727aa",
                                                "sense_id": "3981257d-bc22-3e31-8386-9eacd766eda0",
                                                "text": "Victor prit son téléphone, shoota quelques objets, son canapé, sa psyché, son tapis de course et, depuis son balcon en saillie, il immortalisa la ville repoussant la lumière qui l’orangeait."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d6fddf19-290f-47ac-ac09-ae38beed27ff",
                        "source_entry_id": "a42afe72-cb1f-3efa-8c8a-7b1063d80157",
                        "source_sense_id": "1401f34c-f9f4-3120-adb3-c281201ee2ca",
                        "source_sense_description": "repellent",
                        "target_lang_word": "répugnant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "répugnant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a92f69b-e29c-35cc-8466-df3925eccc06",
                                        "entry_id": "aa3b1928-5d7e-34e0-9f9f-561dc0ea50dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui répugne ; repoussant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28c24fea-eaca-498a-91fd-3be98ef18c7e",
                                                "sense_id": "5a92f69b-e29c-35cc-8466-df3925eccc06",
                                                "text": "Le crapaud ne nous apparait, au bout du compte, ni plus disgracieux ni plus répugnant que bien d’autres créatures naturelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcea65f0-ff3f-480f-8481-7efd3a7992cb",
                                                "sense_id": "5a92f69b-e29c-35cc-8466-df3925eccc06",
                                                "text": "J’ai fait des représentations au grand vizir et ai dû revenir à la charge à plusieurs reprises pour faire cesser cette pratique répugnante."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83bab6b3-8a0e-45cf-9c7b-130e510c0a85",
                                                "sense_id": "5a92f69b-e29c-35cc-8466-df3925eccc06",
                                                "text": "Et le fait est qu’il est répugnant, le mouchoir ; mais lui s’en fout.."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75aadfc2-23ff-430c-b508-d57f483e0575",
                                                "sense_id": "5a92f69b-e29c-35cc-8466-df3925eccc06",
                                                "text": "Le mâle est sale, les hommes ne se lavent pas, ils laissent la saleté et les liquides répugnants de leurs sécrétions s’accumuler sur eux, et ils n’y touchent pas, comme si c’était un bien précieux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "répugnant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24392530-04dc-3525-a297-675b2c29ef70",
                                        "entry_id": "cb4feae0-d151-3ac9-bbd7-b2f3176877f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Participe présent de répugner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee6ca3a2-c06a-4e8d-8122-d6bf95b15808",
                        "source_entry_id": "a42afe72-cb1f-3efa-8c8a-7b1063d80157",
                        "source_sense_id": "1401f34c-f9f4-3120-adb3-c281201ee2ca",
